    <action path="/yourAction"
            type="com.yourapp.YourAction"
            name="yourActionForm"
            scope="request"
            input="/yourForm.jsp">
        <forward name="success" path="/success.jsp"/>
        <forward name="failure" path="/error.jsp"/>
    </action>
</action-mappings>
```

5. **Display the error message in your JSP**: In your JSP file (e.g., `error.jsp`), use the Struts HTML tag library to display error messages.

```jsp
<%@ taglib uri="http://struts.apache.org/tags-html" prefix="html" %>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Error Page</title>
</head>
<body>
    <html:errors/>
</body>
</html>
```

