  1/2 Sum[ginv[[i, m]] * (dg[[m, k, j]] + dg[[m, j, k]] - dg[[j, k, m]]), {m, 3}],
  {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {k, 3}
];
```

4. Simplify the expressions:
The expressions for the metric tensor components and Christoffel symbols can be quite complex, so it's often useful to simplify them.

```mathematica
